  "caveats": [
    "The targets are the Research Alpha labeller's calls, not author annotations: the scores measure how well a model trained on streamed atlas cells reproduces the atlas labels on studies it never saw. The labeller's own per-study accuracy against CELLxGENE author labels is 0.84 / 0.75 / 0.43 / 0.32 (levels 1-4; docs/cell_annotation.md).",
    "Throughput was measured from a laptop on a residential link; the link capacity measured next to each run is reported, and the stream ran at about that capacity. A cluster node was not used (Alpha jobs had priority on Clipper).",
    "A few samples the cell index lists are not in the released study manifests (withheld studies, excluded samples); the loader skips and counts them (samples_skipped).",
    "One pass over the training stream, one seed; no hyperparameter search."
  ]
